HELP.md
.gradle

### Gradle build outputs ###
# `cpf-tools/build`는 제품 Build Tooling Source Owner이므로 전역 `build/` 패턴을 사용하지 않습니다.
# 실제 Gradle 산출물 경로만 명시적으로 제외합니다.
/build/
/cpf-admin/build/
/cpf-batch/build/
/cpf-batch/*/build/
/cpf-biz-admin/build/
/cpf-common/build/
/cpf-core/build/
/cpf-gateway/build/
/cpf-member/build/
/cpf-reference/build/
/cpf-starters/*/build/
/cpf-tools/runtime/*/build/
/local-domains/*/build/
!gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
!**/src/main/**/build/
!**/src/test/**/build/

### CPF tracked build tooling source ###
# `cpf-tools/build` 아래 Platform BOM과 Convention Plugin Source는 반드시 Git 추적 대상입니다.
!/cpf-tools/
!/cpf-tools/build/
!/cpf-tools/build/**
# 격리 Build에서 생성되는 실행 산출물만 제외합니다.
/cpf-tools/build/*/build/
/cpf-tools/build/*/.gradle/

